  "_base_url": "The address the TVs use to reach this PC. Because each TV's browser homepage is set to a URL containing it, it MUST NOT change - give this host a reserved/static IP and put it here before setting any homepages. Leave blank only for testing, which auto-detects the current address. Target PC is 192.168.1.246, so set: http://192.168.1.246:8899",
  "base_url": "http://192.168.1.246:8899",
